          {%- assign index_textes_fr = 'Dix minutes sur les groupes que la s&eacute;ance va charger, juste avant de commencer.|Dans l&apos;heure qui suit, sur ce qui vient de travailler. Le plus simple &agrave; tenir.|Un cr&eacute;neau fixe, sans d&eacute;pendre d&apos;un entra&icirc;nement. Celui qui survit aux mois.|Sur peau nue et propre, jug&eacute; &agrave; seize semaines et pas &agrave; sept jours.|Dix minutes de face, dix de dos. Plus rien &agrave; d&eacute;cider.|Pendant que vous travaillez, sans quitter votre poste.' | split: '|' -%}
          {%- assign index_textes_en = 'Ten minutes on the groups the session will load, right before you start.|Within the hour, on what just worked. The easiest one to keep.|A fixed slot, independent of any workout. The one that survives the months.|On clean bare skin, judged at sixteen weeks and not seven days.|Ten minutes facing, ten with your back. Nothing left to decide.|While you work, without leaving your desk.' | split: '|' -%}

          {%- for h in index_handles -%}
