              <p class="ln-wave__text">{% if is_fr %}La longueur d&apos;onde rouge la plus &eacute;tudi&eacute;e du domaine, pr&eacute;sente sur la quasi-totalit&eacute; de la gamme.{% else %}The most studied red wavelength in the field, present across almost the entire range.{% endif %}</p>
